# Fonts (optional, skipped by `brewpick --all`)
#
# MonoLisa is a paid font (personal license, no Homebrew cask) — select it via
# `bin/brewpick` to open the purchase/download page. Raw `brew bundle` rejects
# a `manual` line outright; `brewpick --all` strips these before running it.
manual "MonoLisa" # https://www.monolisa.dev/

# VS Code extensions
#
# `bin/brewpick --all` installs all of these (it strips the `manual` entries
# above, which raw `brew bundle` rejects). Run `bin/brewpick` with no arguments
# to interactively select a subset via fzf instead.

